# Project decisions

Full text: `docs/DECISIONS.md`.  
Plot UX: `docs/AI-deployment/TASK_PLAYBOOKS/11_scientific_plots_ux.md`.

- When the user locks a requirement, update DECISIONS (and this rule if it changes how code must be written).
- Prefer the living architecture guide / playbook 11 over ad-hoc notebook patterns when they conflict.
- Scientific plots: retain axis ranges on invert; Preview ≠ Apply; tables over JSON dumps; collapsed dense panels; PNG/JPEG/TIFF export (inches + DPI) in Plot settings.
- Standalone updates: check GitHub Releases on launch; banner + release link; optional confirmed zip install (preserve `data/`/`venv/`); configure via `GITHUB_REPO`.
- Default UI language is **Russian** (EN available in sidebar).
- Page order: Home → Import → Interactive → analysis pages → Documentation → Settings.
- Install/run scripts must stay scripts-first with clear, actionable errors.
- App version: root `VERSION` + git tag `vX.Y.Z` (`src/utils/version.py`).
- Do not invent product rules — ask.
